"""The shared database (schema `photos` in the `omarchy` Postgres, see jburnhams/database docs/ADOPTING.md): everything about the pictures that is not the pictures themselves. Needs the packages omarchy-db, pgvector and psycopg (in the `dev` group of pyproject.toml); nothing else in stratastills imports this package yet.

The `vector` extension lives in schema `public` of `omarchy`, but omarchy_db migrates with search_path set to the app's schema alone: a revision that creates a vector column first runs `SET LOCAL search_path TO photos, public` (see the initial one). At run time the URL should say `search_path=photos,public`."""
